sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant VOS as VectorOperationsService
    participant WAL as WAL/Memtable
    participant IX as IndexManager
    participant SST as SST Engine
    participant VIP as VIPER Engine
    participant CACHE as Cache System
    
    Note over C,CACHE: Search with Metadata Filter + Distance Query
    
    C->>VOS: search(collection_id, query_vector, k, metadata_filter)
    
    Note over VOS: Query Planning Phase
    VOS->>VOS: Analyze filter selectivity
    VOS->>VOS: Determine optimal filter order<br/>(metadata-first vs distance-first)
    
    Note over VOS,WAL: WAL Search (Always Executed)
    VOS->>WAL: search_unflushed(query)
    WAL->>WAL: Apply CompositeBloomFilter
    WAL->>WAL: Filter by metadata (95% reduction)
    WAL->>WAL: Calculate distances (SIMD/GPU)
    WAL-->>VOS: unflushed_results[]
    
    Note over VOS,IX: Index Search (If Available)
    VOS->>IX: check_index_availability(collection_id)
    
    alt Index Available in Memory
        IX-->>VOS: index_handle
        VOS->>IX: search_index(query_vector, k)
        IX->>IX: Navigate HNSW/IVF structure
        IX->>IX: Get candidate vectors
        IX-->>VOS: index_results[]
    else Index Evicted or Not Available
        IX-->>VOS: null (fallback needed)
        Note over VOS: Fallback to Storage Engines
    end
    
    Note over VOS,SST: SST Engine Search (Row-based)
    VOS->>SST: search_sst(query, metadata_filter)
    
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over SST: Three-Stage Filter Pipeline
        SST->>SST: Stage 1: Bloom Filter Check
        SST->>SST: Check file-level bloom filters
        SST->>SST: Skip files with no matches (95% reduction)
        
        SST->>SST: Stage 2: Index Block Filter
        SST->>SST: Load SSTable index entries
        SST->>SST: Check min/max statistics
        SST->>SST: Skip blocks outside range (60-80% reduction)
        
        SST->>CACHE: check_decompression_cache(block_ids)
        alt Blocks in Cache
            CACHE-->>SST: cached_blocks[]
        else Cache Miss
            SST->>SST: Load and decompress blocks
            SST->>CACHE: store_in_cache(blocks)
        end
        
        SST->>SST: Stage 3: Row-Level Filter
        SST->>SST: Apply metadata predicates
        SST->>SST: Filter individual records
        SST->>SST: Calculate distances for qualified rows
    end
    
    SST-->>VOS: sst_results[]
    
    Note over VOS,VIP: VIPER Engine Search (Columnar)
    VOS->>VIP: search_viper(query, metadata_filter)
    
    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note over VIP: Columnar Optimization Pipeline
        VIP->>VIP: Predicate Pushdown
        VIP->>VIP: Push filters to Parquet reader
        VIP->>VIP: Use row group statistics
        VIP->>VIP: Skip row groups (70-90% reduction)
        
        VIP->>VIP: Column Pruning
        VIP->>VIP: Load only required columns
        VIP->>VIP: Skip unnecessary metadata columns
        
        VIP->>VIP: Two-Stage Search
        VIP->>VIP: Stage 1: Search quantized column (INT8/PQ)
        VIP->>VIP: Get top 10x candidates
        VIP->>CACHE: get_fp32_vectors(candidate_ids)
        alt FP32 Vectors Cached
            CACHE-->>VIP: cached_vectors[]
        else Cache Miss
            VIP->>VIP: Load FP32 column for candidates
            VIP->>CACHE: cache_vectors(vectors)
        end
        VIP->>VIP: Stage 2: Rerank with FP32
        VIP->>VIP: Precise distance calculation
    end
    
    VIP-->>VOS: viper_results[]
    
    Note over VOS: Result Merging & Deduplication
    VOS->>VOS: Combine results[WAL + Index + SST + VIPER]
    VOS->>VOS: Apply MVCC resolution
    VOS->>VOS: Remove duplicates (keep highest version)
    VOS->>VOS: Sort by distance
    VOS->>VOS: Take top-k results
    
    VOS->>CACHE: store_query_result(query_hash, results)
    VOS-->>C: SearchResponse{results[], latency_ms}
    
    Note over C,CACHE: Search Complete